A quick brief into $STRC.

@Strategy, formerly MicroStrategy, is a Nasdaq listed company having one of the largest Bitcoin Treasury as company's holding.

Strategy is als the largest independent, publicly traded business intelligence company - take a look at the business model: https://t.co/BsjNvjguK4

STRC is not pure yield insulation.

@marcarjoon breaks down why the initial drop looked like ex-dividend mechanics, but the next leg lower tracked Bitcoin weakness.

"This instrument is still somewhat correlated to Bitcoin on the downside." https://t.co/DbsKMjbM1d
